"The program didn’t close. Force quitting ends it right away, and anything unsaved is lost." = "此程式沒有關閉。強制結束會立即停止它，未儲存的內容將會遺失。";
"To free a port, quit the program that holds it: in the program itself or in Activity Monitor." = "若要釋放連接埠，請結束佔用它的程式：直接在該程式中結束，或在「活動監視器」中結束。";
